== Walkthrough ==
There doesn't appear to be any intro text associated with this quest.  Hailing Chef Dooga will give you dialogue options for the [[Preserved Meat Delivery]] quest.  But it still works.

Chef Dooga is located at (201,-243) in Oggok.

'''Give Chef Dooga 3 x [[Pickled Froglok]] and 10 gp.''' (1 platinum also works.)

: Chef Dooga says 'You gud baker!! Here take dis, it got sum stains, but still gud.'

