The [[Ogre Butcher Apron]] vendors to [[Chef Dooga]] for over 8gp, making this a cheap quest for repeating.

== Faction Notes ==
<ul>
<li>I did 33 turn-ins with my Rallos Zek worshiping Barbarian Warrior, and went from Dubious with Chef Dooga and Clurg to Apprehensive, allowing me to trade with them. I also went from Threatening to Dubious with the warrior guild, and was thereafter able to walk freely among my fellow warriors. The shadowknight guild started out Threatening, and was still Threatening after I finished all the turn-ins, unfortunately. The Ogre guards inside of Oggok also went from Dubious to Apprehensive, as did the Ogre guards out in the Feerrott. Most of the other non-guild merchants in Oggok were all still dubious to me however, so I'm not sure what faction they're actually on because it doesn't seem to be Clurg.


<br />&nbsp;<br />33 more turn-ins a few days later resulted in the shadowknight guild's view of me shifting from Threatening to Dubious. Clurg and Chef Dooga remained at apprehensive, as did the guards. The warrior guild also remained at dubious.
</li>
<li>
As a Halfling Druid (Karana) it took me 101 or 102 turn-ins to get to dubious. I had a faction hit to Clurg early in this character's life from killing [[Corflunk]], so it's likely that the actual number required is an even hundred.
<br />
</li>
</ul>

